end":204,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、卜辭或未定指代，未補成員姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m013-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、卜辭或未定指代，未補成員姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m013-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"子我","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002746","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m013-0220","start":220,"end":222,"surface":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002744","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p014","text":"簡公出奔，田氏之徒追執簡公于徐州。簡公曰：「蚤從御鞅之言，不及此難。」田氏之徒恐簡公復立而誅己，遂殺簡公。簡公立四年而殺。於是田常立簡公弟驁，是爲平公。平公卽位，田常爲相。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"御鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002745","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"田常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002726","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"驁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002729","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002729","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002729","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m014-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"田常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002726","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p015","text":"田常旣殺簡公，懼諸侯共誅己，乃盡歸魯、衞侵地，西約晉、韓、魏、趙氏，南通呉、越之使，修功行賞，親於百姓，以故齊復定。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"田常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002726","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m015-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m015-0025","start":25,"end":33,"surface":"晉、韓、魏、趙氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、卜辭或未定指代，未補成員姓名與親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:p002","text":"已而大夫鮑氏、高、國之屬害之，譖於景公。景公退穰苴，苴發疾而死。田乞、田豹之徒由此怨高、國等。其後及田常殺簡公，盡滅高子、國子之族。至常曾孫和，因自立為齊威王，用兵行威，大放穰苴之法，而諸侯朝齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"鮑氏","kind":"unresolve